&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in derivatives sales, trading, or structuring (crypto or FX/rates/equities) with direct P&amp;amp;L responsibility and a proven track record of independently sourcing and closing high-value clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of the UAE, MENA, and European crypto regulatory and market environment, with demonstrated experience executing regional growth strategies in derivatives markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable expertise in perpetual futures, futures, and options, with existing relationships across prosumer and advanced retail clients in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with active and prosumer traders (e.g., high-value retail, professional day traders, social/desktop trading communities), ideally on derivatives platforms, with a track record of consistently meeting or exceeding revenue or volume targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly within the UAE, MENA, and Europe for client meetings, events, and conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
