&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;The Operations Manager will play a critical role in scaling Coinbase&#39;s regulated presence in Abu Dhabi, partnering directly with the Senior Executive Officer to drive operational excellence across it&#39;s core businesses trading. This is a high-impact role at the intersection of operational strategy, regulatory compliance, and cross-functional execution in one of the world&#39;s fastest-growing crypto markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Senior Executive Officer in overseeing and managing operational functions within ADGM, including intragroup and third-party service providers, ensuring delivery aligns with local regulations and contractual obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the implementation of operational policies, procedures, SLA frameworks, and risk management processes across key business workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain supervision frameworks across critical business areas — including trading, staking, and custody operations — in line with regulatory and best-practice requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain robust operational resilience frameworks, including risk identification, contingency planning, and vulnerability mitigation to ensure continuity of critical business functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate responses to operational incidents, facilitating timely communication with internal stakeholders, regulators, and third-party service providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage strong relationships with banks, regulators, and internal stakeholders to effectively communicate operational and risk strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project manage critical operations and risk-related initiatives across cross-functional teams including Legal, Compliance, Security, Finance, Product, and Customer Service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support first-line-of-defense operations across key areas including launch assessments, approvals, staffing, and audit activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in Middle East financial services, management or strategy consulting, or operations strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within a regulated investment dealer environment, with focus on trade supervision across crypto, equities, or derivatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to develop new processes and improve existing workflows to drive operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to collaborate across a broad range of business functions, with an emphasis on senior management engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to produce high-quality content and materials suitable for external audiences with minimal review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, with proven ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the crypto/Web3 landscape, including digital asset markets and tokenization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
