&lt;p&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Unified Custody roadmap end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the product strategy for custody model optionality, so customers choose self-custody, custodial, or hybrid per use case without rebuilding integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering, security, legal, and compliance to launch custody and DeFi products that meet the institutional bar for key management, controls, and regulatory posture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer and launch-partner needs into a prioritized roadmap tied to assets-on-platform and revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and grow adoption: AOP and revenue, with clear funnel metrics from integration to funded accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience shipping developer-facing or API-first products, ideally custody, wallets, or fintech infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of crypto custody models (self-custody, MPC, qualified custodian) and DeFi primitives (lending, vaults, onchain yield).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of shipping 0-to-1 products with engineering teams and taking them to production scale with enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in regulated environments; experience partnering with legal and compliance on licensing, asset segregation, and risk frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
