&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Coinbase is building its regulated presence in the Middle East, and this role sits at the center of that expansion. In this role, you&#39;ll drive Coinbase&#39;s regional crypto strategy, manage critical regulatory relationships, and build the operational foundation for our growing business. This is a rare opportunity to shape how crypto capital markets develop in one of the world&#39;s most strategically important financial centers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead the locally based Abu Dhabi team, managing Coinbase&#39;s Middle East crypto business and ADGM legal entity while engaging senior regulators, clients, and industry stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the development and execution of Coinbase&#39;s UAE crypto strategy in close collaboration with the Dubai/VARA team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop operational capacity to grow Coinbase&#39;s tokenization business and adjacent opportunities under ADGM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee strategic budgeting and resourcing to optimize business impact and ensure alignment with local and global financial frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish robust governance structures, including controls, compliance programs, and ethical leadership practices that align local operations with global standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead ongoing engagement with ADGM and FSRA, cultivating trusted relationships with senior regulators and key external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion Coinbase&#39;s culture within the entity, ensuring customer interests are appropriately prioritized and strategy aligns with Coinbase&#39;s global business model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of senior-level experience in financial services, including experience with securities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of ADGM/FSRA regulatory requirements covering best execution, client assets, custody, market conduct (FSMR, COBS, MIR), and AML frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in operational oversight, including policies and procedures development and monitoring of day-to-day business activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how regulated financial services functions operate (Compliance, Finance, Risk, Treasury, Audit, Outsourcing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence and drive alignment across senior, peer, and junior stakeholders regionally and globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment in assessing and escalating risk, with excellent written, verbal, and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining strong relationships with regulators, specifically ADGM and FSRA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the crypto/Web3 landscape, including tokenization, DeFi, and digital asset markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
