&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Senior Frontend Engineer, Portfolio&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Portfolio team within the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot;&gt; Consumer &amp;amp; Business&lt;/a&gt; group owns how millions of Coinbase users understand what they hold and how it&#39;s performing. We build the balances, holdings, and profit-and-loss experiences at the core of the Coinbase app and website, the surfaces users open first, check most often, and trust most. As a Senior Frontend Engineer on Portfolio, you&#39;ll turn complex, real-time financial data into clarity for every kind of Coinbase user, from first-time buyers to sophisticated traders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the design and delivery of core Portfolio experiences including balances, holdings, and PnL across web (React/TypeScript) and native mobile (iOS and Android)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build performant, accessible, pixel-accurate UI that renders real-time financial data at Coinbase scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with backend, design, and product to take ambiguous problems from scoping through production rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive frontend architecture and quality including component reuse, state management, testing, and performance instrumentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen the team&#39;s engineering bar through rigorous code reviews, technical mentorship, and well-documented architecture decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of frontend engineering experience building consumer-facing web applications with high-quality, well-tested production code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in React and TypeScript, with strong command of modern frontend fundamentals (state management, rendering performance, accessibility)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record shipping and owning complex features end-to-end in production, ideally in financial, trading, or other data-intensive applications where accuracy and latency matter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building real-time or high-throughput UIs and integrating with backend APIs (REST/GraphQL), with consistent collaboration alongside design and product partners to shape product outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
