&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Coinbase is building the future of institutional trading as part of the Everything Exchange, powering the systems that let the world&#39;s largest financial institutions trade across markets with speed, depth, and trust. As a Senior Data Engineer, Market Data on the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Institutional&lt;/a&gt; Markets team, you&#39;ll build and operate the systems that capture, normalize, and distribute real-time market data across Coinbase at low latency - the feed handlers, venue connectors, and distribution layer that form the backbone of a unified trading platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain market data components including feed handlers, normalization pipelines, distribution systems, and venue connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement low-latency, high-throughput services for real-time market data consumed by trading systems across the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive reliability and performance improvements through observability, on-call participation, and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write high-quality, well-tested code and contribute to engineering standards on a lean team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineers, product managers, and cross-functional stakeholders to deliver market data capabilities that support Coinbase&#39;s institutional trading roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of backend engineering experience building and maintaining production low-latency systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with at least one area of market data infrastructure (feed handlers, normalization, or distribution).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in low-latency Java (or C++) and familiarity with high-throughput messaging frameworks (Aeron, SBE, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with venue/exchange connectivity and market data protocols (FIX, ITCH/OUCH, multicast).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record shipping features end-to-end and operating what you build in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
