&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Infrastructure Marketing team is building awareness and demand for Coinbase&#39;s stablecoin payments, trading, agentic finance, and custody products. As Senior Product Marketing Manager, you&#39;ll lead integrated marketing initiatives that span content, demand generation, events, and sales enablement. You&#39;ll own go-to-market strategy for key product areas and drive programs that generate qualified pipeline in a fast-moving, dynamic environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot; data-bdocs-generated-heading-id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional marketing initiatives across content, demand generation, events, communications, and sales enablement to build awareness and generate qualified leads for Coinbase&#39;s infrastructure products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute go-to-market strategies for PSPs, money movers, cross-border companies, and banks, focused on reaching, engaging, and activating them through targeted messaging and campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive marketing for agentic finance across Coinbase for Agents and agentic payments, including thought leadership content, social campaigns, and product announcements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with tier-one partners on co-marketing programs, from partnership launch planning through ongoing activation and performance measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;required-skills-and-experience&quot; data-bdocs-generated-heading-id=&quot;required-skills-and-experience&quot;&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in payments, stablecoins, or fintech marketing, with a track record of building go-to-market strategies that drove measurable pipeline or revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of product marketing experience in a startup or high-growth environment, including ownership of positioning, messaging, and launch execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to write clear, compelling blog posts, partner briefs, and sales collateral that are accurate, tailored to each audience, and polished, with a sharp eye for editing your own work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and managing co-marketing programs with external partners, including joint campaign planning and cross-functional coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
