&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Recruiter to join our Core Recruiting team within People Success. This team owns hiring across Coinbase&#39;s G&amp;amp;A, Customer Experience, EAA and IT, and you&#39;ll be responsible for owning full-lifecycle recruiting across your portfolio. Depending on business needs, you may also support product group hiring, so flexibility across talent markets is key. You&#39;ll partner with hiring managers to deeply understand their talent needs, build strong pipelines, and contribute to process improvements that help the recruiting team scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full recruitment lifecycle from role intake through close across your portfolio, with the flexibility to support both G&amp;amp;A and technical requisitions as business needs shift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build candidate pipelines through self-sourcing and competitive research, ensuring sufficient depth and quality at each stage to maintain hiring velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with hiring managers across your client groups to translate hiring needs into effective search strategies and a strong candidate and interviewer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data integrity and use pipeline analytics to inform hiring efficiency, surface bottlenecks, and improve outcomes for your hiring teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to recruiting process improvements and pilot programs that help the team scale its impact across global markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full-lifecycle recruiting experience in a technology company or similarly fast-paced, high-growth environment, with demonstrated success closing competitive candidates across G&amp;amp;A and/or technical functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to ramp quickly on new role types and talent markets, with the flexibility to shift between business and technical requisitions as priorities evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge across the entire candidate lifecycle, from talent mapping and sourcing through interviewing and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven approach to pipeline management with the ability to translate recruiting metrics into actionable recommendations for hiring managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
