&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Backend/Fullstack (Coinbase Advisor - Agentic Trading)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Software Engineer to join the Coinbase Advisor team within the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Consumer &amp;amp; Business&lt;/a&gt; group. Coinbase Advisor is the world&#39;s first RIA-licensed agentic trading system: an AI advisor living inside the Coinbase app that holds a natural conversation about a user&#39;s portfolio, gives personalized financial advice, and executes trades on their behalf. This role is primarily backend on a full-stack team. You&#39;ll own the services that make agentic trading feel fast, clear, and trustworthy for millions of customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own backend services powering Coinbase Advisor and Strategies, from technical design through launch and ongoing operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build integrations with Coinbase&#39;s trading APIs so agent recommendations and user-configured strategies translate into correct, auditable execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop our agentic harness, including tool calling, orchestration, persistent state, and recovery from failed or partially completed actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape agent behavior through prompt engineering, evals, and conversation analysis, partnering with our registered investment adviser on changes to financial advice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve service reliability, latency, observability, and execution safety, including retry behavior and safeguards against duplicate actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with frontend engineering, product, design, trading infrastructure, and legal/compliance to ship customer-facing capabilities within regulatory guardrails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional software engineering experience, with deep backend expertise and a track record of shipping and operating production services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with API design, distributed systems, data modeling, testing, and debugging production failures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Go or demonstrated ability to learn it quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building production LLM or agentic systems, including tool calling, orchestration, or evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to take ambiguous projects from zero to production with minimal oversight and sound product and technical judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
