&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Software Engineer to join the Retail DEX team within the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot;&gt; Consumer &amp;amp; Business&lt;/a&gt; group. This team runs all the data and trading systems that power onchain (&quot;DEX&quot;) trading within the main Coinbase app, enabling millions of traders to buy and sell 70M+ tokens on major blockchains including Base and Solana. You&#39;ll build software systems that straddle the off-chain and onchain worlds to deliver a seamless, unified trading experience regardless of where an asset settles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate new blockchains, decentralized exchanges, and launchpads into the main Coinbase app to unlock more onchain assets for millions of traders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement first-party smart contracts for onchain trading primitives such as DEX aggregation and advanced order types to improve execution quality and capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale real-time data pipelines to handle 100K+ messages per second, enabling millisecond-latency processing of blockchain market data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize the trading stack end-to-end to deliver the fastest execution, most optimal fills, and most comprehensive asset coverage for DEX traders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive iteration on agentic-first development patterns, building self-improving software systems and tooling that accelerate team velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in backend software engineering with demonstrated success building and operating data systems or data pipelines in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience designing data-intensive systems and integrating with large-scale data infrastructure such as Kafka, Clickhouse, Starrocks, Temporal, and Redis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and integrating with onchain smart contracts on EVM (Ethereum, Base) or Solana, with deep understanding of the programming models of one or more of these virtual machines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build, iterate on, and improve agentic-first code repositories and software systems in production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
