&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Software Engineer, Frontend to join the &lt;strong&gt;Consumer Payments team&lt;/strong&gt; within the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer Product Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. This team owns the infrastructure, experiences, and controls that power how millions of users send, receive, and move crypto on Coinbase. You&#39;ll own critical user journeys across web and mobile, building fast, reliable, and delightful payment flows while mentoring junior engineers and driving down customer friction at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end frontend development for core crypto money movement experiences, including send, receive, and transaction status tracking across web and mobile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable improvements in CUJ latency, availability, and SLOs for the payment flows you own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build new user-facing features - such as contact management systems and real-time transaction status trackers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, design, and backend engineering to scope, prioritize, and ship projects that reduce CX contact rates and improve the customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve frontend performance bottlenecks across payment flows, reducing end-to-end latency and improving reliability for millions of users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required skills and experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software engineering experience with deep expertise in React and React Native&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of shipping consumer-facing products end-to-end in a high-scale environment, with a focus on performance, reliability, and user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning SLOs and driving measurable improvements in latency and availability for user-facing flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to mentor junior engineers and operate as a senior technical voice on a team of mixed levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
