&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Social team builds Coinbase&#39;s brand where the internet lives. We&#39;re hiring a Social Media Manager to grow Coinbase&#39;s prediction markets presence, starting with @CoinbasePredict on X. You&#39;ll turn live markets into real-time content across finance, sports, politics and culture, making Coinbase the place people go to see what the world thinks will happen next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot; data-bdocs-generated-heading-id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own @CoinbasePredict day to day, creating high-quality, original content including memes, commentary and real-time market reactions for @CoinbasePredict and @Coinbase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track trends, culture and competitor activity across X and social platforms to spot opportunities and turn hot topics into timely content and live contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product marketing, product, legal, compliance and creative teams to bring prediction markets launches and campaigns to life on social.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build content processes, editorial systems and AI-assisted workflows that let the team post fast and stay compliant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategies to monitor, advise on and respond to FUD with both immediate and long-term approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze performance data to optimize content strategy, grow followers and increase engagement across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;required-skills-and-experience&quot; data-bdocs-generated-heading-id=&quot;required-skills-and-experience&quot;&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years managing brand or creator social accounts with demonstrated audience growth and viral content wins, especially on X.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Power user of prediction markets who actively follows multiple categories across sports, entertainment, politics and finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talented copywriter and meme-maker with a direct, non-corporate style and experience creating short-form video content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of rapidly iterating content strategy based on performance data and stakeholder feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a daily content calendar across multiple platforms while responding to real-time news cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
